    "@@ -986,6 +986,18 @@\n",
    " - **The one-axiom case.** With the axiom as a condition, widening is retaining and adding what has significance, keeping the same is retaining both ways, and being mixed is adding both ways (`Web.widens_iff_retains_adds`, `Web.keeps_iff_retains`, `Web.mixed_iff_adds`): the reduction to possibilities loses nothing. The rules above are derived with no axiom, so, as Ren said, they are stated with none; these three stay for the one-axiom case (Part II).\n",
    " \n",
    " **What it does not derive.** “More futures” is a partial order: mixed parts still need a measure to be ordered. The sentence works as the definition of a region, not as a fact about everything: some parts lessen what can form. What does not come along is the “ought”: that narrowing a future which never returns to oneself is wrong for oneself. That was the axiom's step of invariance (section 6.11); after the reduction it becomes the content of calling the generative space good, an open question of warrant and no premise of any law (section 8). The readings and names are the AI's, pending Ren.\n",
    "+\n",
    "+<a id=\"comparison-content-under-regrouping\"></a>\n",
    "+\n",
    "+### 6.14 比较内容怎样由关系约束（P91）/ Relational constraints on comparison content (P91)\n",
    "+\n",
    "+先由同一展开中的依存、给予和取用说明什么能继续，再比较这些内容。改变名称或描述粒度本身不增添生成。新的 [Regrouping](../../../experiments/integrated-correction/general-framework/generative-basis/lean/becoming/Becoming/Regrouping.lean) 保留原过程，只合并其主张：一组被实现，当且仅当其中有成员被实现。局部的精确条件是同组成员在所读配置中同样成立；这恰好允许从分组恢复每项原内容。在比较的两处满足该条件，既有扩展比较保持不变。\n",
    "+\n",
    "+这一条件可以由实际支持关系给出。对于“接下来能形成什么”的读法，同样的依存和阈值足够；若依存可判定，则在所有水平测试下无损合并的**充要条件**是每一步各项最低所需相同（不依存的条件所需为零）。这是接纳内容的刻画，不是生命同一性：共同需要相同，不等于不同生活可以互换；共同实现与后续作用若相关，须作为比较内容保留。局部保真只涉及正在比较的路线，所有水平的条件另有更强范围。\n",
    "+\n",
    "+反面由同一交换律生成的两条可行路线检验。搬运一单位支持，实际打开第二种形成并关闭第一种；保留原位则相反。两条路线共用初态和其余交换律，均平衡且可行。把两个不同依存的形成合为一类，分组描述便显示相同，真实得失却仍是混合。这里查明的是描述遗漏，没有以任意标签反驳完整关系论，也没有断言搬运或不搬运天然较好。\n",
    "+\n",
    "+**Current scope.** On one unchanged process, faithful regrouping preserves the existing extension comparison. For decidable requirements, all-level admission fidelity holds exactly when minimum required profiles agree. This compares support possibilities, not identities or all joint futures. Two feasible courses generated under one rest-law exhibit real opposed gains which an unfaithful grouping hides. The result supplies a representation condition to the existing comparison; it neither imposes losslessness on every action nor ranks all mixed losses. The significance premise and stronger zero-substantive-axiom foundation retain their distinct scopes. See the [result](../results/records/comparison-content-under-regrouping.md) and [argument, connection and counterreview](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ETHICAL-LEARNING-INTEGRATION.md#relational-comparison-content).\n",
    " \n",
    " ## 第一部分的总陈述 / Part I stated whole\n",
